From 32c223d5ffcb10affa858c10bd9b4dd74471008a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Satpute Sandeep <sandeep.satpute@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Jul 2025 05:04:17 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 004/190] misc: xilinx-ai-engine: fixed col clock
 enable/disable request from user in aie2ps

commit 22cce11d02d62cace962e49e2adef868ed6cc535 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Fixed column clock enable/disable request from user in
aie2ps_set_part_clocks api. This will ensure column clock register will
filled with proper value.

Signed-off-by: Satpute Sandeep <sandeep.satpute@amd.com>
Acked-by: Govindarajulu Varadarajan <govindarajulu.varadarajan@amd.com>
Message-ID: <20250716120417.2560945-1-sandeep.satpute@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 drivers/misc/xilinx-ai-engine/ai-engine-aie2ps.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/misc/xilinx-ai-engine/ai-engine-aie2ps.c b/drivers/misc/xilinx-ai-engine/ai-engine-aie2ps.c
index 16436f5a7055..8d94a831fdde 100644
--- a/drivers/misc/xilinx-ai-engine/ai-engine-aie2ps.c
+++ b/drivers/misc/xilinx-ai-engine/ai-engine-aie2ps.c
@@ -3228,7 +3228,7 @@ static int aie2ps_set_part_clocks(struct aie_partition *apart)
 			prev_range = op_range;
 		}
 	}
-	if (!prev_ops)
+	if (prev_ops)
 		ret = aie_part_pm_ops(apart, NULL, prev_ops, prev_range, 0);
 	if (ret)
 		return ret;
-- 
